{"slug": "nasa-searches-for-life-from-the-moon-in-recently-rediscovered-historic-footage", "synopsis": "Made in 1969 at NASA\u2019s Ames Research Center, the film documents researchers examining lunar rocks and soil returned by the Apollo 11 astronauts. Wearing protective clothing, masks, and gloves, laboratory staff handle containers through enclosed workstations, prepare dishes and test tubes, and operate specialized equipment. Their work seeks evidence of life native to the Moon and organic compounds that could serve as building blocks of life.\\\\n\\\\nClose views emphasize the careful handling and testing of the samples inside laboratory cabinets. The examinations found no lunar life.", "clips": [{"id": "fd535a5a-50e5-5066-a9ed-a65af69f4541", "sourceSlug": "nasa-searches-for-life-from-the-moon-in-recently-rediscovered-historic-footage", "sourceTitle": "NASA Searches for Life from the Moon in Recently Rediscovered Historic Footage", "sourceYear": 1969, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 7.549, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/nasa-searches-for-life-from-the-moon-in-recently-rediscovered-historic-footage/clips/0000000000-0000007549.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/nasa-searches-for-life-from-the-moon-in-recently-rediscovered-historic-footage/thumbnails/0000000000-0000007549.jpg"}, {"id": "41b4fc50-6e68-5f6c-88b7-82cd6617465c", "sourceSlug": "nasa-searches-for-life-from-the-moon-in-recently-rediscovered-historic-footage", "sourceTitle": "NASA Searches for Life from the Moon in Recently Rediscovered Historic Footage", "sourceYear": 1969, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 7.549, "endSeconds": 51.593, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/nasa-searches-for-life-from-the-moon-in-recently-rediscovered-historic-footage/clips/0000007549-0000051593.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/nasa-se